OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain should
OL,6,Fcontinue to edge erratically
OL,7,Fsouthwards, perhaps stalling over the
OL,8,Fsouth of the region, but leaving
OL,9,Fmainly fine, if rather cloudy,
OL,10,Fconditions to its north. Warm and
OL,11,Fhumid, with the breeze easing.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FBrightest in the north, with
OL,14,Fthe best sunny spells here. Meanwhile
OL,15,Fsouthern parts staying cloudier and
OL,16,Fmore humid, with some rain and
OL,17,Fdrizzle. Generally brighter later.
OL,18,FWinds falling light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
